.* QUIRPTVW: a report's lines on a display (DSPPGMREF, DSPAUDJRNE with
.* OUTPUT(*)). RPTTITLE is the title; F19 and F20 shift the lines.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=TITLECL BASETYPE='CHAR 60'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LINECL BASETYPE='CHAR 78'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=RPTTITLE CLASS=TITLECL.
:VAR NAME=RPTFILE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RPTCOLS CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LINE CLASS=LINECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=LINES VARS='LINE'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=F19 ACTION='RETURN 19'.F19=Left
:KEYI KEY=F20 ACTION='RETURN 20'.F20=Right
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=RPTVIEW KEYL=KEYS HELP=RPTVIEWH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE BOTSEP=NONE.&RPTTITLE.
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=RPTFILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:DATAIX VAR=RPTCOLS USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Columns
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LINES SCROLL=YES COMPACT.(The report has no lines.)
:LISTCOL VAR=LINE USAGE=OUTPUT.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=RPTVIEWH.Report - Help
:P.The lines the command wrote, as it would print them. Page up and
down to read them; F19 and F20 move the columns shown left and right.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave, F17 and F18 go to the first and the last line,
F19 and F20 shift the lines left and right.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
